{"total_count":2,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/connollydavid/host-lint/commits/f1474e87162f3bdfa76f75840eb1fc7de87b6b84","sha":"f1474e87162f3bdfa76f75840eb1fc7de87b6b84","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0MTI2MTI3MDM3NDpmMTQ3NGU4NzE2MmYzYmRmYTc2Zjc1ODQwZWIxZmM3ZGU4N2I2Yjg0","html_url":"https://github.com/connollydavid/host-lint/commit/f1474e87162f3bdfa76f75840eb1fc7de87b6b84","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/connollydavid/host-lint/commits/f1474e87162f3bdfa76f75840eb1fc7de87b6b84/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/connollydavid/host-lint/git/commits/f1474e87162f3bdfa76f75840eb1fc7de87b6b84","author":{"date":"2026-06-25T18:33:27.000+01:00","name":"David Connolly","email":"david@connol.ly"},"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T18:33:27.000+01:00","name":"David Connolly","email":"david@connol.ly"},"message":"release v0.10.0: the prose lane consults the LEXICON (plan/0044, host-lint #16)\n\nThe --prose and --docs lanes now mask a sanctioned LEXICON phrase before the\nhost-grammar density engine, the same pre-detection blank-out the naming lane\nperforms. A declared multi-word domain phrase clears the trope within it, while a\nstandalone occurrence of the word still flags. The mask feeds both the per-tell\nscan and the document density score, so a declared phrase contributes to neither.\n\nscan_prose_text and run_docs take the allow-list; the README masked-modes wording\nadds --prose and --docs. Two unit tests and two integration cases pin the\nbehaviour. Closes host-lint #16.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/connollydavid/host-lint/git/trees/cb6f03f3ad8a59bacffbb8350b53d69a4ce22440","sha":"cb6f03f3ad8a59bacffbb8350b53d69a4ce22440"},"comment_count":0},"author":{"login":"connollydavid","id":266389644,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-DIjA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266389644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users