 so clean-to-zero terminates. Case-insensitive matching\nkeeps sentence-initial tells located. Golden tests + the obligations digest re-record.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/connollydavid/host-lint/git/trees/0c18d47e6b49627a12cf813e7f1aa19d05b5bbc1","sha":"0c18d47e6b49627a12cf813e7f1aa19d05b5bbc1"},"comment_count":0},"author":{"login":"connollydavid","id":266389644,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-DIjA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266389644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid","html_url":"https://github.com/connollydavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"connollydavid","id":266389644,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-DIjA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266389644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid","html_url":"https://github.com/connollydavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connollydavid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.